    <h1>Moringa: the leaf behind the bright green powder</h1><p class="dek">Where Moringa comes from, what's in a teaspoon, and the easiest ways to use it.</p>
    <div class="ba-author"><img src="{{ 'mark.png' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="170" height="145" loading="eager"><span><b>Written by Team Veda</b><time datetime="2026-10-05">Oct 05, 2026</time></span></div>
