      <h2 id="faq">Frequently asked questions</h2><details class="ba-faq"><summary>When should I take Moringa?</summary><p>Most people enjoy it in the morning, stirred into a smoothie or juice.</p></details><details class="ba-faq"><summary>What part of the Moringa plant is the powder made from?</summary><p>Only the leaf of the Moringa oleifera tree. Our label lists a single ingredient — Moringa leaf.</p></details><details class="ba-faq"><summary>What does Moringa powder taste like?</summary><p>Fresh, grassy and slightly earthy. It pairs best with fruit in smoothies and juices, and half a teaspoon is a good starting amount.</p></details>
